      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REBORN MYSTIQUE (8) has a strong record this trip with five wins and two placings from 11 starts. Hit the frame latest (23.21) when second at this track in a Grade 4/5. Has the ability and should feature. JILLIBY EATON (5) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish third (30.54) at Wanganui in a Class 2 over 520m. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Expected to feature again. ASTON PRESIDENT (1) has been in super consistent form, last time breaking from this same box when second in a Grade 4/5 at Taree Super Track (17.59) and making it three straight placings. Expected to feature. STAR (4) racing over this distance brings the best out in her.",
